Z||000000||kinboyatuwo||01-18-2001||02:06 PM||||Is this hard.  I am not sure if i will do ti or a shop.<BR>It has a hole that is slowly getting bigger.  <BR>I figure ok bye bye cat.<P>Steps<BR>1 remove with a hacksaw or simlar tool<BR>2 measure and aquire right length of exaust pipe (can be before step 1)<BR>3 insert and secure above fore mentioned pipe<BR>4 drive car<P>am i missing any thing??  <BR><P>------------------<BR>"Friends don't let friends drive four doors."||||reg||4
